and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/field-matrix.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/arc01-contract-and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/output-01.log\",\"project01-portable-persistence/arc01-contract-and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/protocol.md\",\"project01-portable-persistence/arc01-contract-and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/read-contract.md\",\"project01-portable-persistence/arc01-contract-and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/result-01.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/arc01-contract-and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/validate.py\",\"project01-portable-persistence/arc01-contract-and-mongo-pilot/slice02-portable-contract-design/artifacts/design-pass05/validation.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/README.md\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/attempt01-mismatches.json.gz\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/attempt01-summary.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/attempt01.cjs\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/attempt02-mismatches.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/attempt02-summary.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/attempt02.cjs\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/conversation-pairings.json\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/probe.cjs\",\"project01-portable-persistence/research-inventory/claude-reconciliation-20260920/skipped-source-locators.json\",\"project01-portable-persist